Button labels (Share / Edit / Delete) were visible on screens ≥ 640 px due to `hidden sm:inline`, and the theme-switch icon animation was a barely-noticeable 0.4 s quarter-turn.

## Changes

- **Icon-only buttons** — replaced `hidden sm:inline` with `sr-only` on label spans inside Share, Edit, Delete, and Active/Inactive toggle buttons in `PollPage.jsx` and `FeedbackList.jsx`. Text is now visually hidden at every breakpoint; screen readers still get the label.

  ```jsx
  // before
  <span className="hidden sm:inline">Edit</span>

  // after
  <span className="sr-only">Edit</span>
  ```

- **Theme-switch animation** (`index.css`) — updated `spin-in-clockwise` to a full 360 ° rotation at 0.9 s `ease-in-out`, making the transition clearly perceptible on toggle.

  ```css
  /* before: -135deg → 0deg, 0.4s ease-out */
  @keyframes spin-in-clockwise {
    from { transform: rotate(-135deg) scale(0.6); opacity: 0; }
    to   { transform: rotate(0deg)    scale(1);   opacity: 1; }
  }
  .animate-theme-icon { animation: spin-in-clockwise 0.4s ease-out; }

  /* after: 0deg → 360deg, 0.9s ease-in-out */
  @keyframes spin-in-clockwise {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg)   scale(0.7); opacity: 0; }
    to   { transform: rotate(360deg) scale(1);   opacity: 1; }
  }
  .animate-theme-icon { animation: spin-in-clockwise 0.9s ease-in-out; }
  ```

